    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 599,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "1. Beta status"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b0c780be837e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 662,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA is currently in private beta. Features,",
        "data structures, interfaces and support",
        "scope may change. Some capabilities may",
        "be unstable or temporarily unavailable."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9a7b6c32d7a6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 798,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "2. User data"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-399642a4862f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 861,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Users retain the relevant rights in content",
        "they enter, edit and import. PAIA aims to",
        "make this material viewable, manageable",
        "and exportable, rather than create barriers",
        "by locking in user data."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5a24d5d2a62b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1024,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "3. Backups"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-bf7e6f2499f5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1087,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "During beta, do not use PAIA as the only",
        "copy of important data. Keep independent",
        "backups of material that needs long-term",
        "preservation."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ccb4d57744aa",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1223,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "4. Acceptable use"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d702c60fe4d5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1286,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Do not use PAIA for unlawful activity,",
        "unauthorized data collection, violations of",
        "others’ privacy or intellectual property, or",
        "circumvention of third-party access and",
        "usage restrictions."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5341165bab3d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1449,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "5. Third-party services"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d59bf2c0ed94",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.023",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1512,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA may work with browsers, AI services",
        "and other third-party platforms. PAIA does",
        "not control their availability, terms or",
        "technical changes, which may require",
        "changes to related features."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2b56bd0fc1a4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1675,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "6. Availability and limitations"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-633a817979a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1738,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "The beta is provided in its current state,",
        "without a promise of continuous, error-free",
        "or permanent availability. The product",
        "seeks to reduce data risks, but users should",
        "keep independent backups of important",
        "material."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-98fbd7865446",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-390.026",
